Add files.find + files.thumbnail; fix SFTP chroot path mapping

- files.find: search a tree by name glob/extension (read-only), returning
  path, size, mtime, extension; tolerates unreadable dirs.
- files.thumbnail: render an image or video frame with ffmpeg on the NAS and
  fetch it locally. Fetches bytes over exec (base64) because UGOS chroots the
  SFTP subsystem to the share root, so /tmp is unreachable via SFTP. Forces
  yuvj420p and retries without -ss when a seek yields no frame.
- Config gains sftpRoot (defaults to defaultShare) and upload/download now map
  exec paths to the chroot-relative SFTP path, fixing transfers on UGOS.
- 39 tools total; 33 tests pass.
